  "exercise_count": 14,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设 $A(a)$ 和 $B(b)$ 是数轴上的两点. 我们现在来求这两点间的距离.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 118,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们知道，为了求出数轴上某线段的长度，应当从线段右端点的坐标减去左端点的坐标.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 118,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果点 $A(a)$ 在数轴上位于点 $B(b)$ 的左边（图22），那么$b>a$，并且 $|AB|=b-a$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 118,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#8",
        "p0125#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-22",
      "label": "图 22",
      "printed_page": 118,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图22",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 22",
      "printed_page": 118,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果点 $A(a)$ 在点 $B(b)$ 的右边（图 23），那么 $a>b$，并且$|AB|=a-b$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-23",
      "label": "图 23",
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 23",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 23",
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果点 $A(a)$ 和 $B(b)$ 重合，那么 $a=b$，并且 $|AB|=0$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由于 $|a-b|=|b-a|$，所以上述公式可以合并成一个公式：$|AB|=|a-b|$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**数轴上两点之间的距离等于这两点坐标的差的绝对值。**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "应用这个结论不难证明，**线段中点的坐标等于两个端点****坐标的算术平均数。**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设 $p(x)$ 是线段中点，这个线段的端点是 $A(a)$ 和 $B(b)$，并且 $a<b$（图 24）。这时，$|AP|=x-a$，$|PB|=b-x$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-24",
      "label": "图 24",
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 24",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 24",
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为 $P$ 是线段 $AB$ 的中点，所以$x-a=b-x$，$2x=a+b$，$x=\\frac{a+b}{2}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "应用“数轴上两点之间的距离”的概念，可以解如下形式的不等式：$|x-a|<b$ 和 $|x-a|>b$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 119,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0125#13",
        "p0126#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们举两个例子。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 1 解不等式 $|x-2|\\leqslant3$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这个问题可用另外一种方式叙述：在数轴上找出满足如下条件的点的坐标集合，这些点到坐标为 $2$ 的点的距离不大于 $3$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在数轴上画出坐标为 $2$ 的点。距这点有三个单位的两点，其坐标分别等于 $-1$ 和 $5$（$2-3=-1$，$2+3=5$）（图 25）。这两点之间包含的所有点（并且只有这些点）到坐标为 $2$ 的点的距离小于 $3$ 个单位。这就是说，所求的点的坐标集合是数区间 $[-1,5]$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-25",
      "label": "图 25",
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 25",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 25",
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：$[-1,5]$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 2 解不等式 $|x+3|>5$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "不等式 $|x+3|>5$ 和不等式 $|x-(-3)|>5$ 同解。利用数轴（图 26），找到距坐标为 $-3$ 的点有 $5$ 个单位的两点，其坐标分别等于 $-8$ 和 $2$。与坐标为 $-3$ 的点之间的距离大于 $5$个单位的点，有且仅有在坐标 $-8$ 左边的点和坐标 $2$ 右边的点。因此原不等式的解集合是两个开的数射线 $]-\\infty,-8[$ 和$]2,+\\infty[$ 的并集。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#10",
        "p0126#13",
        "p0127#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-26",
      "label": "图 26",
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 26",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 26",
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0126#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：$]-\\infty,-8[\\cup]2,+\\infty[$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 121,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0127#2"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
